# 10. Build an in-app "Report a Problem" feature

I strongly recommend this for PayslipMax.

Put somewhere under:

**Settings → Help → Report a Problem**

When tapped, it could generate:

```text
PayslipMax Diagnostic Report

App: 1.0.3 (23)
Android: 16
Device: Pixel 8
Architecture: arm64

Last screen: Payslip Import
Last operation: PDF parsing
Parser: GrammarAwareParser v4
Format: EXTENDED_GRID

Crash ID:
abc123...

[Describe what happened]

________________________

[ Send Report ]
```

Again:

**NO payslip data.  
NO salary figures.  
NO personal information.**

This is especially important given PayslipMax's privacy positioning.

