# 11. Give every installation an anonymous ID

Instead of:

```text
Sunil Pawar
Army Number...
email...
```

generate:

```text
Installation ID:

PMX-A7F39C
```

Then the tester can tell you:

> My ID is PMX-A7F39C.

Crashlytics shows:

```text
PMX-A7F39C
Crash #482
```

Now you can correlate the human report with the telemetry without knowing their identity.

Crashlytics supports associating an identifier with reports; Firebase recommends using identifiers rather than putting identifying values directly into exception messages. 

