# 12. Version every component that matters

Don't just record:

```text
App v1.0
```

For PayslipMax I would have:

```text
App version        1.0.3
Build              23

Parser             4.2
Database schema    7
PDF extractor      2.1
Ruleset            2026.09
```

Imagine six months from now:

> "March 2025 payslips sometimes fail."

You can query:

```text
parser_version = 4.1
```

and discover:

```text
4.1 → 17 failures
4.2 → 0 failures
```

That becomes enormously useful.

