# 13. Feature flags become important later

Suppose you release:

```text
NewParserV5 = ON
```

and crashes suddenly spike.

You don't necessarily want to wait for Google to approve another release.

With a remote feature flag:

```text
NewParserV5 = OFF
```

you can potentially disable the problematic feature remotely.

Firebase Remote Config is one way of doing this.

Professional teams frequently build **kill switches** around risky functionality.

For PayslipMax, eventually consider flags such as:

```text
new_parser_enabled
cloud_backup_enabled
ai_insights_enabled
new_pdf_extractor_enabled
revenuecat_paywall_v2_enabled
```

Don't over-engineer this today, but understand the concept.

