# 14. Staged rollout is one of your biggest protections

Don't think:

```text
Version 2.0
        ↓
100% users
```

Think:

```text
Version 2.0
     │
     ▼
    5%
     │
  observe
     │
     ▼
   10%
     │
  observe
     │
     ▼
   25%
     │
  observe
     │
     ▼
   50%
     │
  observe
     │
