# 18. Treat crashes differently by severity

Eventually triage like this:

### P0 — emergency

```text
App won't launch
Data corruption
Data loss
Security/privacy leak
Most users crashing
```

Immediate action.

### P1 — critical

```text
PDF import crashes
Subscription broken
Backup/restore broken
Major Android-version crash
```

Fix urgently.

### P2 — significant

```text
Specific payslip format fails
Rare device issue
Screen rendering problem
```

Next release.

### P3 — minor

```text
Cosmetic issue
Animation glitch
Small UI problem
```

Backlog.

Without severity classification, developers often spend three hours fixing a button margin while a database migration is destroying production sessions.

