# 21. PayslipMax has an unusual privacy requirement

This deserves special emphasis.

A normal shopping application can afford fairly aggressive analytics.

**You should not.**

You're handling military personnel's financial documents.

I would establish a hard telemetry policy:

```text
                    TELEMETRY

        ALLOWED                    NEVER SEND
           │                           │
           ▼                           ▼
     App version                 Name
     Build number                Army/service no.
     Android version             PAN
     Device model                Bank details
     Screen                      Salary
     Operation                   Allowances
     Parser version              Deductions
     Format ID                   Tax values
     Error type                  PDF text
     Duration                    PDF itself
     Page count                  Filename*
     File-size bucket            Extracted content
     Anonymous ID
```

This policy should eventually be documented in your architecture.

